547580/extras/4cf3158199c9039e33ecca90e9bd2b7b.mp4?t=1748475401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not <strong>listen to yourself</strong>, you know the direction, do not stumble and keep moving even when there is nothing left to move with. The source of water is already very close, do not be <strong>afraid of emptiness</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of it</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid</strong>...<br><br>Features: <br>- Graphics stylized as PS1 <br>- Various dangers <br>- Well-developed artificial intelligence of jackals</p>",
